{"actor":"Jes Wolfe!","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-03-22T17:14:34Z","event_type":"status_changed","id":81,"issue_id":"CX-dvt","new_value":"{\"status\":\"in_progress\"}","old_value":"{\"id\":\"CX-dvt\",\"title\":\"Run bartleby in commonplace sandbox\",\"description\":\"Set up bartleby (autonomous Claude agent) as a sandbox-exec process. Reads prompts from prompts.txt, writes output.txt. Command: uv run --project /home/jes/bartleby python /home/jes/bartleby/bartleby.py. Needs BARTLEBY_WORKING_DIR env var pointing to sandbox dir. Source config in /home/jes/commonplace-rs/workspace/__processes.json.\",\"status\":\"open\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"owner\":\"jes5199@gmail.com\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-22T17:05:39Z\",\"created_by\":\"Jes Wolfe!\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-22T17:05:39Z\"}"}
{"actor":"Jes Wolfe!","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-03-22T17:14:36Z","event_type":"status_changed","id":82,"issue_id":"CX-g8o","new_value":"{\"status\":\"in_progress\"}","old_value":"{\"id\":\"CX-g8o\",\"title\":\"Run text-to-telegram in commonplace sandbox\",\"description\":\"Bridge Telegram messages to/from CRDT docs. Incoming messages append to content.txt, outgoing read from input.txt. Command: uv run --project /home/jes/text-to-telegram python -m text_to_telegram. Needs config.json with bot token + chat_id. Source config at /home/jes/commonplace-rs/workspace/text-to-telegram/__processes.json.\",\"status\":\"open\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"owner\":\"jes5199@gmail.com\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-22T17:05:39Z\",\"created_by\":\"Jes Wolfe!\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-22T17:05:39Z\"}"}
{"actor":"Jes Wolfe!","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-03-22T17:14:37Z","event_type":"status_changed","id":83,"issue_id":"CX-uww","new_value":"{\"status\":\"in_progress\"}","old_value":"{\"id\":\"CX-uww\",\"title\":\"Run file-tmux-file in commonplace sandbox\",\"description\":\"Bridge tmux pane content to/from CRDT docs. Captures pane content to content.txt, sends commands from input.txt. Command: uv run --project /home/jes/file-tmux-file file-tmux-file. Source config at /home/jes/commonplace-rs/workspace/tmux/__processes.json.\",\"status\":\"open\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"owner\":\"jes5199@gmail.com\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-22T17:05:40Z\",\"created_by\":\"Jes Wolfe!\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-22T17:05:40Z\"}"}
